;    7: TDecorate(count=114, unk2=5265653, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    8: TDecorate(count=11, unk2=16776960, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    9: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=だま, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   10: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=あき, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   11: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=のぞ, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   12: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=ろっこつ, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   13: TDecorate(count=3, unk2=16757864, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   14: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=くもん, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   15: TDecorate(count=3, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=よだれ, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   16: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=あふ, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
; Display conditions:
;    0: TWdCondition(count=6422, target=)
; Links:
;    0: TWdLink(count=5541, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>It seemed I had slept without so much as a dream.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\サード\新村本家2階夕方.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
From outside the window, an <STYLE ID="1" RUBY="だいだい">orange</STYLE> light that might have been sunset or sunrise―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Judging by the direction, it's probably sunrise.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, you awake?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\誰もいない校舎で.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Niimura... senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Good. Your eye color's back to normal."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\布団.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
At those words, I bolted upright.<PG>
My eye color is back to normal!?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I see...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Kana-chan</STYLE> must have knocked me out, and then I was carried here and given falsificaso.<PG>
The murderous urge I felt in that basement room was absolutely not a dream.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Rather than feel that again, I'd be far better off having my stomach surgically removed without anesthesia.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That was how intense and horrifying it was.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"I'm sorry..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\swish.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組みアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
At that, <STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE> gently put her arms around me.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"What're you apologizing for...? </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> did the right thing. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">―sneaking into the storehouse before you met her was the right call!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I understood what <STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> meant.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Running into <STYLE ID="5">Sakura-san</STYLE> at that moment, with that timing, had been a stroke of luck amid the misfortune.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I had come face to face with <STYLE ID="5">Sakura-san</STYLE> knowing nothing, I might have killed <STYLE ID="5">Sakura-san</STYLE>.<PG>
And another feeling was surging over me as well.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Sadness―that was the feeling.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A sadness that rivaled that murderous urge.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It took me a little while to realize what it was.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">... she died..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yeah! I'm just as sad as you!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> hugged me even tighter.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then the tears that had been building and building inside my body came spilling out.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The tighter <STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE> held me, the more tears were wrung out of me.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> died―and I'm sad―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That I can feel sad that <STYLE ID="6">Senpai</STYLE> died―
{PAUSE ""}
makes me happy.<PG>
That I don't need <STYLE ID="6">Senpai</STYLE> because I've gained the power of sensing danger―
{PAUSE ""}
that's a lie.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I don't need sensing danger, so come back, <STYLE ID="6">Senpai</STYLE>...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ふすま.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Phantom Thief</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, you awake?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Oh, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">. </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto's</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> fine now."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"I see... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Sorry, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">... about </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Mifuyu-chan's</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> funeral today..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Don't worry about it. After what happened, there's no helping it if we can't hold the funeral."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"You can't hold the funeral?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花頭かく.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Oh, um... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">See, we were making the medicine for the funeral, but we used it on </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, and there was no time to be making more, so..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"I'm sorry..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I told you, it's fine!"</STYLE><PG>
The one at the root of my sadness was <STYLE ID="8">Mifuyu Niimura</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Not being able to hold <STYLE ID="8">her</STYLE> funeral would probably weigh on <STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai's</STYLE> heart.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Guilt, and a feeling that rebelled against it, were tangled together inside me.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Uh, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Look, she's right next to </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家布団.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜死ぬ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Beside me, <STYLE ID="4">Kana-chan</STYLE> was breathing softly in her sleep.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">This kid</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> was up late helping out to save </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> too, so make sure you thank her properly later."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yes... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">And </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"She's resting in another room. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">It's okay, she isn't hurt, and she's not mad at </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> either."</STYLE><PG>
What did I come here for...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had meant to keep up a perfectly ordinary front, and instead I had caused this much trouble.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\サード\新村本家2階夕方.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> read the book in the storehouse, didn't you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Sorry..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"No need to worry about it. That book was exactly what you needed, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Once you've rested enough, come downstairs. I'll tell you everything."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, you rest a little longer. It's still only 5 a.m."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, haven't you and </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> slept?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"No, come on, never mind about us."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Senpai's</STYLE> eyes, so sharp until a moment ago, were bleary and sleepy.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Had seeing that I was cured let her relax?<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">I'm still sleepy... Could you sleep next to me?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花頭かく.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">... acting like a little kid... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組みアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Yeah... let's get some sleep together."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\swish.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE> held me in her arms as she burrowed into the futon.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家布団.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Welcome back."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"No... it's just, ever since </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> died, you haven't seemed like the usual </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"You noticed?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Course I did. This is me and </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> we're talking about..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"If you noticed, you could've said something..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> dying was a shock to you, I figured. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">But </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">your</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> eyes right now are the same as before."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">I'm home..."</STYLE><PG>
I made it back.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
From that world held captive by curse-killing, I've come back to the world where I lost <STYLE ID="6">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Something to be glad about, and something to grieve.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"When we get back to Motoki-cho, I want to properly visit </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kogori-senpai's</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> grave."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yeah. We've gotta give her a proper memorial, from the heart."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As we talked about it, the loneliness of having lost <STYLE ID="6">Senpai</STYLE> washed over me again.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's so hard to bear, but... 
{PAUSE ""}
that I can feel lonely and sad makes me happy.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> and I fell asleep talking like that.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was a calm conversation, like the ones we used to have.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Making it back... I'm glad...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "5000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "in_dream.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家2階暗い.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―The room was dark.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="4">Kana-chan</STYLE>, who should have been sleeping beside me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Both of them were gone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Had they quietly left the room so as not to disturb me?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ふすま.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\キオク\新村本家2階廊下暗い.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I left the room too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haah, I'm hungry... I hadn't eaten anything in 24 hours.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Still, it was awfully quiet.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYMOVIE "111.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "100" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n50\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
